{"id":"584218","name":"荠菜肉馅包子","author":"萱妈小厨房","authorId":"8741171","desc":"","cover":"images/584218/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荠菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉洗净，放入绞肉机绞成肉沫。","img":"images/584218/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"绞好的肉沫加入蚝油，生抽，料酒，盐搅拌均匀。","img":"images/584218/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"荠菜洗净切碎。","img":"images/584218/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入切好的荠菜。","img":"images/584218/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"包子馅就做好啦。","img":"images/584218/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面粉加入酵母水，先搅拌一下，再揉成团。","img":"images/584218/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉好的面团盖湿布发酵至两倍左右大小。","img":"images/584218/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面发酵好了。","img":"images/584218/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"发酵好的面排气揉匀。","img":"images/584218/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"分切成小剂子。","img":"images/584218/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面剂子擀薄。","img":"images/584218/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/584218/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包好的包子，醒发十五分钟。","img":"images/584218/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"醒发好的包子上锅蒸。","img":"images/584218/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"水开蒸十五分钟左右，关火后闷三四分钟再开盖。","img":"images/584218/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"包子成品。","img":"images/584218/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}